    "detailed_description": "Cute cats will melt the coldest hearts! The wide range of features of the game &quot;1001 Jigsaw. Cute Cats 4&quot; will bring your head to the ground.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a user-friendly game, where everything is thought out for a comfortable game of puzzles. You can use hints to pass the level, take a break saving the result, or select the appropriate level of difficulty if the puzzle is not formed the first time. The game is suitable for all categories of players - from beginners to professionals.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 500 high quality pictures<br />\r\n- Sophisticated game mode with handy hints, sorting and a magnifier<br />\r\n- Individual difficulty settings for each puzzle allow you to play forever<br />\r\n- feature to turn off the rotation of puzzle pieces<br />\r\n- the ability to save and continue a puzzle at any time<br />\r\n- For those who like excitement - special tasks and colorful trophies<br />\r\n- pleasant relaxing music<br />\r\n- New part in the series of games",
